                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "What the hell happened to this game? When I backed the game on Kickstarter years ago, it actually had some interesting gameplay: tile-based strategy, items, multiple characters... That's all gone now. What's left is... a repetitive, unbalanced, and uninspired button-mashing action game.\n\nThis is the first game that after years of work has actually gotten much less developed than when it started! It's sad. I don't know where they're going, but it doesn't seem like a good place. Maybe they plan to someday add all the interesting features back into the game, but for the moment stay away.",
